(7758509, 1284385, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if the shifted layers of the foot is the imperfection in this image or jsut an oversight in editing. But it gets extra pointage for making me stop and think about it.</td>', 'I''m not sure if the shifted layers of the foot is the imperfection in this image or jsut an oversight in editing. But it gets extra pointage for making me stop and think about it.', '2023-10-06 01:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7758510, 1284418, 83313, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene, though I''m not sure how it is beautifully imperfect. But we all have our own interpretations of this topic.</td>', 'Lovely scene, though I''m not sure how it is beautifully imperfect. But we all have our own interpretations of this topic.', '2023-10-06 01:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7758512, 1284413, 6804, '<td valign="top">An excellent perspective of the purity of imperfection.  The imperfection here is clearly in the weathered subject itself rather than a compromise to the photograph.  I see this as a high-quality photograph of a subject with imperfections, which makes the over-all presentation even more enchanting.  Nicely done.  This is my only 10 of the challenge.</td>', 'An excellent perspective of the purity of imperfection.  The imperfection here is clearly in the weathered subject itself rather than a compromise to the photograph.  I see this as a high-quality photograph of a subject with imperfections, which makes the over-all presentation even more enchanting.  Nicely done.  This is my only 10 of the challenge.', '2023-10-06 01:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7758516, 1284412, 6804, '<td valign="top">I really like this photograph! This is one of my higher scoring votes in the challenge.  I keep coming back to this one because it has all the right things in the photo,  but I want to see more in the details and richness of the subject.  Maybe just a little raking light to bring out the grain and shadows a bit more.  I like the title.  It meets the transience portion of the challenge perfectly.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really like this photograph! This is one of my higher scoring votes in the challenge.  I keep coming back to this one because it has all the right things in the photo,  but I want to see more in the details and richness of the subject.  Maybe just a little raking light to bring out the grain and shadows a bit more.  I like the title.  It meets the transience portion of the challenge perfectly.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2023-10-06 01:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7758517, 1284415, 68504, '<td valign="top">I like it becows...</td>', 'I like it becows...', '2023-10-06 01:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
